\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {II}{\ignorespaces  Converged iter2 DESI~DR2 $w_0 w_a$ posterior summary (extracted v1B.0.13 via GetDist on the live converged chain). Chain state at extraction: $N_{\rm  total}=128{,}385$ accepted samples across 16 chains; $N_{\rm  effective}=89{,}871$ after 30\% burn-in discard; $\hat  R - 1 = 0.00820$ (sustained across two consecutive flushes 2026-05-18 01:34 and 07:53 UTC); mean acceptance 0.2828; $\hat  R_{\rm  cl} = 0.0705$ chain-length diagnostic. Likelihood stack: DESI~DR2~BAO + Planck~2018 NPIPE lowl.EE + lowl.TT + highl.CamSpec.TTTEEE + lensing.native + DES-Y5 + Pantheon+. Auditable on-record at \href  {https://github.com/Hubify-Projects/bigbounce/blob/main/reproducibility/cosmology/iter2_converged_2026-05-18/posterior_summary.txt}{\texttt  {reproducibility/cosmology/iter2\_\-converged\_\-2026-05-18/posterior\_\-summary.txt}}. Sampled parameter space: 8 cosmological ($\log A$, $n_s$, $\omega _b h^2$, $\omega _c h^2$, $\tau $, $100\theta _{\rm  MC}$, $w$, $w_a$) + 9 nuisance ($A_{\rm  planck}$, three CamSpec foreground amplitudes, three CamSpec spectral indices, calTE, calEE) $=17$ total --- distinct from the $k=7+7=14$ count for the frozen $\Lambda $CDM+$\Delta N_{\rm  eff}$ chains in Table~\ref {tab:verification}.}}{4}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:iter2_posterior}{{II}{4}{Converged iter2 DESI~DR2 $w_0 w_a$ posterior summary (extracted v1B.0.13 via GetDist on the live converged chain). Chain state at extraction: $N_{\rm total}=128{,}385$ accepted samples across 16 chains; $N_{\rm effective}=89{,}871$ after 30\% burn-in discard; $\hat R - 1 = 0.00820$ (sustained across two consecutive flushes 2026-05-18 01:34 and 07:53 UTC); mean acceptance 0.2828; $\hat R_{\rm cl} = 0.0705$ chain-length diagnostic. Likelihood stack: DESI~DR2~BAO + Planck~2018 NPIPE lowl.EE + lowl.TT + highl.CamSpec.TTTEEE + lensing.native + DES-Y5 + Pantheon+. Auditable on-record at \href {https://github.com/Hubify-Projects/bigbounce/blob/main/reproducibility/cosmology/iter2_converged_2026-05-18/posterior_summary.txt}{\texttt {reproducibility/cosmology/iter2\_\-converged\_\-2026-05-18/posterior\_\-summary.txt}}. Sampled parameter space: 8 cosmological ($\log A$, $n_s$, $\omega _b h^2$, $\omega _c h^2$, $\tau $, $100\theta _{\rm MC}$, $w$, $w_a$) + 9 nuisance ($A_{\rm planck}$, three CamSpec foreground amplitudes, three CamSpec spectral indices, calTE, calEE) $=17$ total --- distinct from the $k=7+7=14$ count for the frozen $\Lambda $CDM+$\Delta \Neff $ chains in Table~\ref {tab:verification}}{table.2}{}}
